# GymBios Mobile Architecture

Feature-first domains under `src/domains/`. Each domain has: `application/`, `domain/`, `infrastructure/`, `presentation/`, `store/`, `index.ts`.

## Dependency flow

Presentation → Application → Domain ← Infrastructure

- Presentation never imports Infrastructure or Axios
- Domain is pure TypeScript (no React/RN/Expo)
- Wire dependencies in domain `index.ts` (composition root)
- `app/` routes only re-export domain screens

## State

- Zustand: client/UI state only
- TanStack Query: server state only

## Modules

- `core/platform/`: OS integrations (storage, API client, notifications)
- `shared/`: generic UI only (Button, Input, Typography)
- Business components stay inside their domain

## Reference

Copy patterns from `src/domains/auth/` for new domains.
